    "detailed_description": "Agent, we have an emergency.<br>The enemy has activated the launch codes for a massive EMP weapon. Your orders are to gather the abort codes that are scattered throughout each of the enemy\u2019s bases.<br>This will be a solo infiltration mission. Good luck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/28e77b33f84e9342af89c1f0f238b693.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/28e77b33f84e9342af89c1f0f238b693.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/28e77b33f84e9342af89c1f0f238b693.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Battle it out as a special agent disguised as a high school girl in this top-down shooter.<br>A variety of terrain types and enemies await you in each stage, called layers.<br>You will need lightning-fast reflexes and sound judgement to come up with the best solutions.<br><br>We\u2019ll supply you with the necessary tools when you sneak in.<br>It\u2019s up to you to make the most of them.<br><br><u>--Reverse Polarity--</u><br>When used, you will reverse the polarity of all bullets around you while reflecting nearby bullets.<br>This is the key to getting out of tricky situations, so use it wisely.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/d528a0c16c59bc1a5fdf65df12aa9b21.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/d528a0c16c59bc1a5fdf65df12aa9b21.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/d528a0c16c59bc1a5fdf65df12aa9b21.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>--Throw--</u><br>Lets you throw objects, kind of like telekinesis.<br>Use it to attack or take cover.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/32a4d82f5c37ef80dc2391fac0209793.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/32a4d82f5c37ef80dc2391fac0209793.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/32a4d82f5c37ef80dc2391fac0209793.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>--Slide Dash--</u><br>Lets you dodge through enemy bullets at high speed.<br>This is a fantastic ability for both offense and defense, so make sure to time it right.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/6f3e9b9ffa21f4b4c5b1c9269216f3ca.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/6f3e9b9ffa21f4b4c5b1c9269216f3ca.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/6f3e9b9ffa21f4b4c5b1c9269216f3ca.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>------Other Features------</strong><br><u>Fashion</u><br>It's pretty bold of ya to be worrying about bling, when you should be focusing on blasting your enemies.<br>Alright, I'll let ya at 'em if you can prove your worth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/27a3a04280cce88c7888d8080545dca0.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/27a3a04280cce88c7888d8080545dca0.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/27a3a04280cce88c7888d8080545dca0.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>New Weapons</u><br>Weapons are, of course, a vital part of executing strategies.<br>When attempting a new layer, try testing out the provided weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/weaponselect.gif?t=1678946115\" /></span><br><u>Additional Challenges</u><br>In Two-Shot and One-Shot modes, a single mistake can be fatal.<br>But if you can make it through these, then you must be the real McCoy. We have high hopes for you, kid.",
    "about_the_game": "Agent, we have an emergency.<br>The enemy has activated the launch codes for a massive EMP weapon. Your orders are to gather the abort codes that are scattered throughout each of the enemy\u2019s bases.<br>This will be a solo infiltration mission. Good luck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/28e77b33f84e9342af89c1f0f238b693.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/28e77b33f84e9342af89c1f0f238b693.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/28e77b33f84e9342af89c1f0f238b693.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Battle it out as a special agent disguised as a high school girl in this top-down shooter.<br>A variety of terrain types and enemies await you in each stage, called layers.<br>You will need lightning-fast reflexes and sound judgement to come up with the best solutions.<br><br>We\u2019ll supply you with the necessary tools when you sneak in.<br>It\u2019s up to you to make the most of them.<br><br><u>--Reverse Polarity--</u><br>When used, you will reverse the polarity of all bullets around you while reflecting nearby bullets.<br>This is the key to getting out of tricky situations, so use it wisely.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/d528a0c16c59bc1a5fdf65df12aa9b21.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/d528a0c16c59bc1a5fdf65df12aa9b21.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/d528a0c16c59bc1a5fdf65df12aa9b21.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>--Throw--</u><br>Lets you throw objects, kind of like telekinesis.<br>Use it to attack or take cover.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/32a4d82f5c37ef80dc2391fac0209793.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/32a4d82f5c37ef80dc2391fac0209793.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/32a4d82f5c37ef80dc2391fac0209793.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>--Slide Dash--</u><br>Lets you dodge through enemy bullets at high speed.<br>This is a fantastic ability for both offense and defense, so make sure to time it right.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/6f3e9b9ffa21f4b4c5b1c9269216f3ca.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/6f3e9b9ffa21f4b4c5b1c9269216f3ca.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/6f3e9b9ffa21f4b4c5b1c9269216f3ca.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>------Other Features------</strong><br><u>Fashion</u><br>It's pretty bold of ya to be worrying about bling, when you should be focusing on blasting your enemies.<br>Alright, I'll let ya at 'em if you can prove your worth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/27a3a04280cce88c7888d8080545dca0.poster.avif?t=1678946115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/27a3a04280cce88c7888d8080545dca0.webm?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/27a3a04280cce88c7888d8080545dca0.mp4?t=1678946115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>New Weapons</u><br>Weapons are, of course, a vital part of executing strategies.<br>When attempting a new layer, try testing out the provided weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298210/extras/weaponselect.gif?t=1678946115\" /></span><br><u>Additional Challenges</u><br>In Two-Shot and One-Shot modes, a single mistake can be fatal.<br>But if you can make it through these, then you must be the real McCoy. We have high hopes for you, kid.",
